  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A student of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> initially at rest takes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> seconds to run up stairs of height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span>. At the top of the stairs the student has a velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the average power supplied by the student during the climb?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgh}{t}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgh+\\frac{1}{2}v^{2}}{t}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgh-\\frac{1}{2}v^{2}}{t}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mgv\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
